# Facts about Old Maud.

@fact maud.groundskeeper
tier: surface
text: Groundskeeper and hedge-witch, keeper of bees, chickens and a goat called Bartholomew.

@fact maud.student
tier: personal
unlock: seen(maud_old_student) > 0
text: She was a student here sixty years ago, the spring the lake froze.

@fact maud.edmund
tier: secret
unlock: seen(maud_old_wand) > 0
text: Edmund went down beneath the lake that night and didn't come back. She kept his silver wand.

@fact maud.soup
tier: personal
unlock: seen(maud_recipe) > 0
text: Her soup cures colds, broken hearts and most curses. You're not allowed to write it down.

@fact maud.garden
tier: personal
unlock: seen(garden_maud_secret) > 0
text: Behind the potting shed there is a door to a garden that only exists for people she shows it to.

@fact maud.age
tier: personal
unlock: seen(maud_ill) > 0
text: She is eighty-one, and says she's allowed the occasional chill.
